  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China-Africa-UNIDO CoE Energy Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The China-Africa-UNIDO Center of Excellence Energy component focuses on advancing Ethiopia#s industrial transformation and agribusiness development through decentralized renewable energy solutions and low-carbon, energy-positive industrial spaces. It aims to strengthen agribusiness resilience by reducing post-harvest losses with clean energy technologies and energy-efficient systems, while enhancing industrial competitiveness through policy support, capacity building, and technology transfer.  This Module 1 on Industrial energy efficiency is focusing on the accelerated adoption of industrial energy efficiency and improved e nterprise environmental performance in Ethiopia#s industrial sector.  This will be achieved by: # Strengthening the national ecosystem for industrial energy and resource efficiency through reviewing and updating policies and reg ulatory frameworks, increasing industrial compliance through training and recommendations, and developing circular economy strategies; and # Strengthening the institutional and technical capacity of key Ethiopian stakeholders and manufacturing industrial enterprises on e nergy and resource efficiency, including on Energy Management Systems (EnMS), Energy Systems Optimization (ESO), Resource Efficient and Cleaner Production (RECP) and circular economy methodologies. T</narrative>
  </description>
